<title>USA: MacroChem stake held by WisdomTree group.</title>
<headline>MacroChem stake held by WisdomTree group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by WisdomTree Capital Management Inc said Tuesday it holds a five percent stake in MacroChem Corp, or 777,400 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include buying 526,900 common shares between Nov 21 and Jan 17 at $4.48 and $6.63 per share.</p>
<p>The group acquired the stake for investment.</p>
</text>
